/-!
# Pruned tree checker (P3c) — Fincke–Pohst with an exact integer LDL certificate

`K · Nmat = Σᵢ cᵢ · ellᵢ ellᵢᵀ` with `ellᵢ` supported on columns `i..11` (upper triangular)
and `cᵢ ≥ 0`. Enumerating `x₁₁, x₁₀, …, x₀` in `{-1,0,1}`, the partial sum
`Σ_{i ≥ j} cᵢ (ellᵢ · x)²` is a lower bound for `K · N(x)`; a node is pruned once it exceeds
`K · 240300`. `certIdentity` checks the decomposition; `goCheck` is the walk.
-/

@[expose] public section

